WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.734 --> 00:00:18.095
Three years passed and Sara was still at Miss Minchin's school.

2
00:00:18.096 --> 00:00:23.399
One winter afternoon Sara returned from a drive in her carriage.

3
00:00:23.400 --> 00:00:30.565
As usual she was dressed in her warmest velvets and furs.

4
00:00:30.566 --> 00:00:35.340
A dirty child stood in the stairway leading to the school's kitchen.

5
00:00:35.341 --> 00:00:38.737
Sara smiled at her. "Hello!"

6
00:00:38.738 --> 00:00:43.579
The girl looked frightened and darted into the kitchen.

7
00:00:43.580 --> 00:00:47.898
"She must be a servant here," Sara thought.

8
00:00:47.899 --> 00:00:52.498
That evening Sara was telling stories to girls in the schoolroom.

9
00:00:52.499 --> 00:00:58.020
Sara's gift at telling stories was, of course, the greatest power that she had.

10
00:00:58.021 --> 00:01:04.579
When she sat in a circle and began to invent things, her green eyes grew big and began to shine.

11
00:01:04.580 --> 00:01:10.105
Her cheeks flushed, and her hands fluttered as she told the tale.

12
00:01:10.106 --> 00:01:15.220
The young servant girl came in to tend the fire.

13
00:01:15.221 --> 00:01:19.029
Everyone was listening intently, even Lavinia.

14
00:01:19.030 --> 00:01:23.381
She was very jealous of Sara's ability to tell stories.

15
00:01:23.382 --> 00:01:28.726
"The mermaids swam about in the green water," Sara went on.

16
00:01:28.727 --> 00:01:32.380
"A princess watched them from the shore."

17
00:01:32.381 --> 00:01:36.950
Sara noticed that the servant was working slowly in order to listen.

18
00:01:36.951 --> 00:01:42.435
She swept the hearth in front of the fire, and then swept it again.

19
00:01:42.436 --> 00:01:46.124
Sara began talking louder so the girl could hear.

20
00:01:46.125 --> 00:01:53.306
The servant girl was so interested in the story that she suddenly dropped her dustpan.

21
00:01:53.307 --> 00:01:58.896
"That servant was listening!" cried Lavinia as the girl fled.

22
00:01:58.897 --> 00:02:04.910
Sara felt a flash of anger. "I knew she was listening. I don't mind."

23
00:02:04.911 --> 00:02:09.012
"Well, you should mind!" Lavinia said.

24
00:02:09.013 --> 00:02:13.172
That night Sara asked Mariette about the servant girl.

25
00:02:13.173 --> 00:02:16.750
"Her name is Becky," replied Mariette.

26
00:02:16.751 --> 00:02:20.458
"She's the kitchen maid and has to work very hard.

27
00:02:20.459 --> 00:02:27.060
All day long she scrubs floors and cleans windows, and carries heavy things up and down the stairs.

28
00:02:27.061 --> 00:02:31.291
She's very timid, and all the other servants are cruel to her.

29
00:02:31.292 --> 00:02:34.818
They constantly order her around."

30
00:02:34.819 --> 00:02:40.210
"Oh, the poor girl," said Sara.

31
00:02:40.211 --> 00:02:44.998
After Mariette left, Sara thought about Becky for a long time.

32
00:02:44.999 --> 00:02:49.686
She even made up some stories about the hard-working servant girl.

33
00:02:49.687 --> 00:02:55.973
One evening, several weeks later, Sara entered her room and found Becky asleep in her chair.

34
00:02:55.974 --> 00:03:04.421
"Oh!" cried Sara softly. "There she is!"

35
00:03:04.422 --> 00:03:08.884
Sara sat down, and watched Becky sleep for a moment.

36
00:03:08.885 --> 00:03:12.517
"Miss Minchin would be angry if she found out about this.

37
00:03:12.518 --> 00:03:15.473
But the poor girl looks so tired.

38
00:03:15.474 --> 00:03:19.118
I'll let her sleep for just a few more minutes."

39
00:03:19.119 --> 00:03:23.751
But then a flaming piece of coal broke off and fell on the hearth.

40
00:03:23.752 --> 00:03:28.688
The sound startled Becky, who opened her eyes with a frightened gasp.

41
00:03:28.689 --> 00:03:32.485
She sprang up and straightened her cap.

42
00:03:32.486 --> 00:03:36.237
Then she caught sight of Sara and her eyes widened.

43
00:03:36.238 --> 00:03:39.193
Surely Becky would lose her job now!

44
00:03:39.194 --> 00:03:42.416
"Oh, I'm so sorry, miss!" she cried.

45
00:03:42.417 --> 00:03:47.877
"I didn't mean to fall asleep in your chair. I just sat down for a minute."

46
00:03:47.878 --> 00:03:54.649
"It's all right." Sara laughed and put her hand on Becky's shoulder.

47
00:03:54.650 --> 00:03:58.494
"You were tired. You couldn't help it."

48
00:03:58.495 --> 00:04:00.522
Becky stared at Sara.

49
00:04:00.523 --> 00:04:04.894
No one had ever spoken to her in such a kind and friendly way.

50
00:04:04.895 --> 00:04:08.998
"Aren't you angry, miss?" She gasped.

51
00:04:08.999 --> 00:04:12.640
"Aren't you going to tell Miss Minchin?"

52
00:04:12.641 --> 00:04:18.260
"Of course not." Sara reached out and touched Becky's cheek.

53
00:04:18.261 --> 00:04:22.794
"We're really the same, you and I. We're both just children.

54
00:04:22.795 --> 00:04:27.170
It's only luck that I'm not you and you're not me."

55
00:04:27.171 --> 00:04:33.619
Becky didn't know how to respond to this. She just said, "Yes, miss."

56
00:04:33.620 --> 00:04:39.380
"Have you finished your work? Can you stay a few more minutes?" Sara asked.

57
00:04:39.381 --> 00:04:42.273
"Here, miss? Me?"

58
00:04:42.274 --> 00:04:46.208
"Yes. I thought you might like a piece of cake."

59
00:04:46.209 --> 00:04:50.895
The next ten minutes seemed like a dream to Becky.

60
00:04:50.896 --> 00:04:55.338
Sara opened a cupboard and gave her a thick slice of cake.

61
00:04:55.339 --> 00:05:00.809
Sara talked and laughed and asked Becky questions.

62
00:05:00.810 --> 00:05:03.730
Becky began to calm down.

63
00:05:03.731 --> 00:05:08.315
She admired the beautiful pink dress that Sara was wearing.

64
00:05:08.316 --> 00:05:13.458
"Once I saw a princess outside the opera house," said Becky.

65
00:05:13.459 --> 00:05:16.719
"You look just like her in that dress."

66
00:05:16.720 --> 00:05:23.248
Sara laughed. "I think I'll start pretending to be a princess."

67
00:05:23.249 --> 00:05:27.953
Sara knew that princesses often gave gifts to other people.

68
00:05:27.954 --> 00:05:31.895
She knew exactly the sort of gift that would please Becky.

69
00:05:31.896 --> 00:05:38.089
"I could tell you some more of my mermaid story every day," offered Sara.

70
00:05:38.090 --> 00:05:42.668
"You mean I could hear it just like the other girls?" Becky asked.

71
00:05:42.669 --> 00:05:45.804
"Yes," Sara answered.

72
00:05:45.805 --> 00:05:50.701
Becky returned to the kitchen, warm, fed, and happy.

73
00:05:50.702 --> 00:05:57.070
Upstairs in her room, Sara was happy too. She was only a pretend princess.

74
00:05:57.071 --> 00:06:05.163
But she had found a way to give real gifts to a poor servant girl.
